<title>USA: Tektronix to buy DynaTech unit.</title>
<headline>Tektronix to buy DynaTech unit.</headline>
<dateline>WILSONVILLE, Oregon 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tektronix Inc said it signed a definitive agreement to buy the business of Dynatech NewStar Inc, a subsidiary of Dynatech Corp.</p>
<p>NewStar makes news room computer systems for the broadcast market and has more than 300 systems installed worldwide. The company had revenues of about $5 million in the last year.</p>
<p>Terms of the purchase, which is expected to close in late October, were not disclosed.</p>
